<title>BOLIVIA: Bolivia's May inflation 0.72 pct - official.</title>
<headline>Bolivia's May inflation 0.72 pct - official.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia's consumer price index rose 0.72 percent in May compared with a rise of 0.39 percent the same month a year earlier, the National Statistics Institute said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The agency added that accumulated inflation in the first five months of the year came in at 1.22 percent.</p>
<p>Annual inflation was 4.77 percent in May, the Institute added.</p>
<p>((--La Paz Newsroom, 005912 391366))</p>
